OL,3,GNEWSAMum seeks answers 10 years after
OL,4,Acustody death
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a woman who died in
OL,7,Fpolice custody 10 years ago is
OL,8,Fconsidering legal action to challenge
OL,9,Fthe delays they have faced with a
OL,10,Fjudicial review.
OL,12,FKelly Hartigan-Burns, 35, was found
OL,13,Funresponsive in a cell in Blackburn,
OL,14,FLancashire, in December 2016 after
OL,15,Fbeing arrested over an alleged assault
OL,16,Fand had earlier tried to take her own
OL,17,Flife.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
